# fixedbugs, defect 151, lane land186, 2026-10-02 (panel 186 R4), found in
# the panel's compiler-engineer's shapes beside the defect.
#
# SYMPTOM: a record over `UAS { kind; union { struct { a; b; }; q; }; }`
# naming `kind` and the union's 64-bit arm `q` was told *does not name `b`*,
# a false refusal: `q` holds every byte of the anonymous struct.
#
# FIX: `a` and `b` share bytes with `q`, the arm the record names, so the
# layout check calls them complete.

extern "fixedbugs-151-unions.h"
    record UAS
        kind: i32
        q: i64
    function make_uas() -> UAS

function main()
    print(make_uas().q)
